05,0.835,0.599,0.575,0.859,0.251,0.429,0.78,0.163,0.852,0.727,0.247,0.101,0.567,0.611,0.443,0.787,0.188,0.093,0.435,0.331,0.208,0.2,0.225,0.168,0.202,0.237,0.198,0.108,0.056],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: Brighid stands in front of her mailbox, sweeping the contents into her bag. What would usually be a small-to-modest pile of flyers, envelopes, packages, and trash now takes up almost the entire aircast mailbox. Once all the mail is loaded, she pulls out her amulet, reading a steady stream of messages, as she sets off back towards the shop.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.608,"end":20.44,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":60,"words":62},"large":{"start":0.608,"end":20.416,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":60,"words":62},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"[Walking FX]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"From Brighid's mobile amulet:","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"LERATO : SENT: 8hrs ago. Hey Brighid, great episode! Fair’s ego would have shot off the charts. Some of my regulars, you know the ones, have been talking about other incidents, too. I told them to send what they got your way. Hope you’re not tired of hearing stories yet!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":21.568,"end":37.024,"frac":0.837,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":49},"large":{"start":21.568,"end":37.024,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":49},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"CHANE : SENT: 1hr ago. Ignore the email spam. I’m resetting our accounts. Some jackass tried using a digital sprite to infect them because of that stupid Laresveila Watcher post. NARRATOR: The post linked reads: “KOOKY FAE PODCAST DEVOLVES INTO CONSPIRACIES AND SLANDER.” CHANE: SENT: 18mins ago. I’m on mute for a few hours. Need to finish final checks for the Severing Remembrance Ceremony. They keep forgetting that if they want me reading announcements then they need to adjust for my vocalizer. CHANE: SENT: 17mins ago. “Can’t you turn it off during announcements?\" What part of, I Don’t Want to be Responsible For Enchanting Anyone don’t they get???!!! Summer’s blessed briefs, Bree. Lots of uniforms hanging around. Must be over the protests.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":37.952,"end":83.296,"frac":0.901,"status":"ok","matched":109,"words":121},"large":{"start":37.952,"end":83.02,"frac":0.901,"status":"ok","matched":109,"words":121},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"NARRATOR: Brighid stumbles slightly as she sees someone across the street that doesn’t belong. They’re a large newspaper attached to a tweed jacket and a Laresveila investigator badge.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":84.224,"end":93.984,"frac":0.893,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":28},"large":{"start":83.02,"end":93.984,"frac":0.893,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":28},"differ":true},{"i":6,"text":"BRIGHID: That’s the investigator who visited Lerato.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":94.592,"end":96.928,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"large":{"start":94.592,"end":96.84,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"NARRATOR: The station’s not far. Maybe he was looking into the now-murder– ah, no such luck. He’s trailing her. And pretty obviously. Was it the aircast? Her testimony? Why sneak around?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":97.408,"end":110.208,"frac":0.906,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":32},"large":{"start":97.408,"end":110.208,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":32},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"BRIGHID: Let’s test this theory…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":111.712,"end":113.024,"frac":0.8,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":5},"large":{"start":111.712,"end":113.024,"frac":0.8,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":5},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"NARRATOR: The Archivist waits for the light to change before breaking into a run.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":113.568,"end":117.088,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":14},"large":{"start":113.568,"end":117.088,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"CYE: Wha—Wait!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":3},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":3},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"NARRATOR: The Investigator runs after her but a sea of people and pavement stand between them. He utilises the only thing he has to prevent her from making the next light & slipping away.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":117.856,"end":128.064,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":33},"large":{"start":117.856,"end":128.064,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":33},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6da9474eea_5-2a.jpg"}